{"title":"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Penny has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f6495923455ae2c228c65395d3a9d48f8743eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> bills. How many <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> bills does she have?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each bill is worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> and the total cost of all of the bills is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f6495923455ae2c228c65395d3a9d48f8743eb4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" />, so Penny has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32f78bcea39c876d4140003d3321b640f61e22d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\$360}{\\$20} = \\boxed{18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"96\" height=\"41\" /> bills in total.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC\">2025 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 4\">Relay B Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 2\">Relay C Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a 